===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To dress or arrange [[smartly]], [[elegantly]], and [[neatly]]; to [[smarten]].
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[refresh]], [[revamp]]; to [[freshen]] or [[improve]] something, especially its [[appearance]].
#: {{ux|en|Fresh paint and some new curtains would do a lot to '''spruce up''' this dark room.}}
